<h2 id="http-test">HTTP Test</h2>

<pre highlight=http>
# Fetch a resource
@host = example.com
GET https://example.com/items HTTP/1.1
  ?limit=10
  &amp;offset=20
Host: example.com
Accept: application/json

###

HTTP/1.1 200 OK
Content-Type: application/json
Location: /items/1

{
  "name": "example",
  "count": 42,
  "active": true
}
